# Architect: self-generating topology. The
# orchestrator DESIGNS the team for the task (picks a shape + writes member roles),
# then runs it. Nothing pre-configured but the designer.
# ALL-CLAUDE: `drives` makes the DESIGNER and the generated team's members/lead all
# Claude Code (smart design + tool-using work). The slowest agent -- a design call
# plus a whole generated team, all Claude -- expect minutes per turn.
#   jet acp-serve acp_architect_demo::Architect::handle examples/acp_architect_demo.jet
module acp_architect_demo
  agent Architect
    runner Architect(drives: "claude-code-acp")
    expose handle(task)
  end
end
